TITLE Mix then heat with calcite; totals for 1 kg of mixed water (2 kg -> 1 kg)

SOLUTION 1 DIC solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50 as HCO3

SOLUTION 2 Ca solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_heat_calcite2.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step temp moles_calcite total_ppt
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TC, EQUI("Calcite"), EQUI("Calcite")*2
END
